    rdfs:comment "사진 관찰에서 SHE 패턴 매칭에 사용할 수 있는 재사용 가능한 시각 단서."@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#VisualTrigger> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#hasWorkActivity> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "작업 활동"@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/context#WorkActivity> ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk#hasFeature> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#hasWorkContext> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "작업 맥락"@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/context#WorkContext> ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk#hasFeature> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#relatedChecklistCue> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "관련 체크리스트 단서"@ko ;
    rdfs:comment "SHE 매칭에 보조 단서로 쓰는 체크리스트 항목. 최종 조치 본체가 아니라 검색 색인/근거 조각이다."@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/guide#ChecklistItem> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#relatedGuide> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "관련 KOSHA 가이드"@ko ;
    rdfs:comment "SHE에 대응하는 개선 절차의 1순위 지식원."@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/guide#KoshaGuide> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#supersededBy> a owl:ObjectProperty,
        owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    rdfs:label "대체된 SHE (supersession chain)"@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> ;
    rdfs:range <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#SituationalHazardPattern> .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#triggerPattern> a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "시각 트리거 패턴"@ko ;
    rdfs:domain <https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#VisualTrigger> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/situation#triggerText> a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
